<%
  title = 'Grabbn Partner Program'
  page  = 'partnership'
%>
<%- include('partials/layout') %>

<div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 space-y-10">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <div class="space-y-3">
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-woodsmoke-950">Grabbn Partner Program</h1>
        <p class="text-base text-woodsmoke-600 leading-relaxed">
            Earn from your buckets, control your ad experience, and promote your work.
        </p>
        <a href="/partnership/apply"
           class="inline-block mt-2 px-5 py-2.5 bg-orchid-600 hover:bg-orchid-700 text-white text-sm font-semibold rounded-md transition-colors">
            Apply Now
        </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Benefits -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-woodsmoke-500 uppercase tracking-wider">What you get</h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-orchid-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="text-orchid-600"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20A10 10 0 0 0 12 2m1 14.93V18a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-1.07A8 8 0 0 1 4.07 9H6a1 1 0 0 1 0 2a6 6 0 0 0 5 5.93V15a1 1 0 1 1 2 0v1.93A6 6 0 0 0 18 11a1 1 0 0 1 2 0a8 8 0 0 1-7 7.93"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-woodsmoke-900">Ad revenue share</div>
                    <div class="text-sm text-woodsmoke-500 mt-0.5">Enable ads per bucket and earn a share of the revenue they generate. Revenue share starts from your approval date.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-orchid-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="text-orchid-600"><path fill="currentColor" d="M3 5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2zm5 7a1 1 0 0 0 0 2h8a1 1 0 1 0 0-2zm0-4a1 1 0 0 0 0 2h4a1 1 0 0 0 0-2z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-woodsmoke-900">Ads toggle control</div>
                    <div class="text-sm text-woodsmoke-500 mt-0.5">Choose whether ads run in each bucket. Opt in to earn; opt out for an ad-free experience.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-orchid-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="text-orchid-600"><path fill="currentColor" d="M3 3h18a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H3a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1m0 8h10a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H3a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1m0 8h6a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v.5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H3a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V20a1 1 0 0 1 1-1"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-woodsmoke-900">Promote your buckets</div>
                    <div class="text-sm text-woodsmoke-500 mt-0.5">Access paid promotion tiers to get your buckets in front of more people.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-orchid-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="text-orchid-600"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10s10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2m-2 14.5v-9l6 4.5z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-woodsmoke-900">More perks coming</div>
                    <div class="text-sm text-woodsmoke-500 mt-0.5">The program is growing. Partners get early access to new features as they ship.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Who it's for -->
    <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-woodsmoke-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Who it's for</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-woodsmoke-600 leading-relaxed">
            The Partner Program is for curators with a consistent track record of quality, values-aligned content. It's not open to everyone — exclusivity is part of what makes it worth having.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-woodsmoke-600 leading-relaxed">
            There's no published numeric threshold. Applications are reviewed by a human. What we're looking for: meaningful curation history and content that reflects well on the platform.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- How approval works -->
    <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-woodsmoke-500 uppercase tracking-wider">How it works</h2>
        <ol class="space-y-3 text-sm text-woodsmoke-600">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-orchid-100 text-orchid-700 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">1</span>
                <span>Submit your application — a short pitch and identity verification.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-orchid-100 text-orchid-700 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">2</span>
                <span>A Grabbn team member reviews your application. We'll get back to you as soon as possible — no fixed timeline.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-orchid-100 text-orchid-700 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">3</span>
                <span>You'll be notified by email. If approved, partner features unlock immediately.</span>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </div>

    <!-- Obligations -->
    <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-woodsmoke-500 uppercase tracking-wider">What we expect</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-woodsmoke-600">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-woodsmoke-300 shrink-0"></span><span>No harmful, misleading, or low-quality buckets.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-woodsmoke-300 shrink-0"></span><span>Partner privilege can be revoked for guideline violations.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-woodsmoke-300 shrink-0"></span><span>Revenue share starts from your approval date — no retroactive earnings for buckets created before approval.</span></li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-woodsmoke-500 uppercase tracking-wider">FAQ</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="border-b border-silver-100 pb-4">
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-woodsmoke-900 mb-1">How long does review take?</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-woodsmoke-500">As soon as possible. There's no fixed timeline — we review applications manually.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="border-b border-silver-100 pb-4">
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-woodsmoke-900 mb-1">Is there a cost to apply?</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-woodsmoke-500">No, applying is free.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="border-b border-silver-100 pb-4">
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-woodsmoke-900 mb-1">When and how do payouts work?</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-woodsmoke-500">Your revenue share accumulates from your approval date. Payouts via Stripe are coming in a future update — no bank details are collected at this stage.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="border-b border-silver-100 pb-4">
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-woodsmoke-900 mb-1">Can I lose partner status?</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-woodsmoke-500">Yes. Partners are held to a higher standard than regular users. Guideline violations can result in privilege removal. After a 9-month waiting period, you may re-apply.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="pb-4">
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-woodsmoke-900 mb-1">What if I have multiple accounts?</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-woodsmoke-500">You can declare linked accounts during your application. You'll need to provide verification details for each one.</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom CTA -->
    <div class="border-t border-silver-100 pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-4">
        <a href="/partnership/apply"
           class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-orchid-600 hover:bg-orchid-700 text-white text-sm font-semibold rounded-md transition-colors">
            Apply Now
        </a>
        <span class="text-xs text-woodsmoke-400">Free to apply &bull; Manual review &bull; No fixed timeline</span>
    </div>

</div>

<%- include('partials/layout-end') %>
